    "detailHtml": "<div class=\"c2026_mark\"></div>\n<h2 class=\"series_copy\">「Sol」<span class=\"c2024_name\">Sol</span></h2>\n\t\n<h3 class=\"series_subcopy c2026b_color\">以沐浴阳光的大地温暖为意象的3支套装，限量发售300套</h3>\n<p class=\"series_bodycopy_c2026\">温柔而柔韧的笔尖，为肌肤呈现自然色彩。<br>从刷杆造型到笔尖，每一处都精益求精，打造出每次使用都能感受到精致肤触与美感的特别套装。</p>\n\t\n<p class=\"photo_title_2024\">● 套装内容</p>\n\n<div class=\"set_photo\">\n\n<map name=\"c2023_img\">\n <area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"313,115,346,425\" class=\"fancybox nonmover\" href=\"images/c2026/sol03_photo.jpg\" data-fancybox data-caption=\"Sol：アイシャドーブラシ\" data-type=\"image\" />\n<area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"235,87,275,425\" class=\"fancybox nonmover\" href=\"images/c2026/sol02_photo.jpg\" data-fancybox data-caption=\"Sol：アイシャドーブラシ\" data-type=\"image\" />\n<area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"108,12,207,425\" class=\"fancybox nonmover\" href=\"images/c2026/sol01_photo.jpg\" data-fancybox data-caption=\"Sol：パウダー／チークブラシ\" data-type=\"image\" />\n</map>\n  \n<div class=\"mrg_bottom20\"></div>\n</div>\n\t\n<h2 class=\"item_title\">S-2026B：CHIKUHODO collection 2026「Sol」</h2>\n\t\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td>品名</td>\n<td>毛材质</td>\n<td>形状</td>\n<td>全长<span class=\"txt_s\">(mm)</span></td>\n<td>毛长<span class=\"txt_s\">(mm)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"#brush01\">蜜粉/腮红</a></th>\n<td>细光峰</td>\n<td>圆平</td>\n<td>165</td>\n<td>50</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"#brush02\">眼影</a></th>\n<td>细光峰</td>\n<td>圆平</td>\n<td>135</td>\n<td>20</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"#brush03\">眼影</a></th>\n<td>加拿大松鼠毛</td>\n<td>圆平</td>\n<td>123.5</td>\n<td>8.5</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n</tr>\n</table>\n  \n\n  \n\n<p class=\"bt_sold\"><span><i class=\"fa fa-cart-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>已售罄</span></p>\n\n  \n<div class=\"item_wrap02 pad_top30 clr\" id=\"brush01\">\n\t<p class=\"set_item_collection\"></p>\n  <p class=\"series_bodycopy\">选用山羊毛中最柔软、稀有度极高的细光峰。柔软之中兼具挺度。精心错开毛尖制成的笔尖，通过分别运用刷面与毛尖，能贴合毛孔、凹凸等细节部位。</p>\n  <div class=\"rgt\"></div>\n  \n  <div class=\"clr wrap_spec\">\n\t\t<div class=\"item_length\"><p class=\"cap\">● 毛长</p></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"item_spec\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"cap\">● 使用感</p>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_a02\"></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_b02\"></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_c02\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n  \n  <div class=\"c2026_powder\">\n    <div class=\"photo_wrap\">\n      <p></p>\n      <p><br>侧面</p>\n    </div>\n    <h4>CHIKUHODO collection　<br class=\"br_sp\">La Mer（蓝色）蜜粉刷</h4>\n    通过增加毛尖厚度来赋予挺度，以轻扫的方式使用，可引出自然光泽感。\n    <h4>CHIKUHODO collection　<br class=\"br_sp\">Sol（茶色）蜜粉刷</h4>\n    通过减薄笔尖厚度、错开毛尖形成层次，打造出轻盈贴肤、毛尖易于贴合肌肤的形状。\n  </div>\n  \n  <iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"470\" height=\"265\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jr5FUmoVunw\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n  <iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"470\" height=\"265\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LNdQUdMLPOM\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" class=\"item_line_collection mov_pad\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n  <iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"470\" height=\"265\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CPza7Aa_lE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" class=\"item_line_collection mov_pad\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n  \n  \n<div class=\"item_wrap02 item_box_line clr\" id=\"brush02\">\n\t<p class=\"set_item_collection\"></p>\n  <p class=\"series_bodycopy\">选用山羊毛中最柔软、稀有度极高的细光峰。柔软之中兼具挺度。为整个眼窝增添华丽色彩。</p>\n  <div class=\"rgt pad_bottom15\"></div>\n  \n  <div class=\"clr wrap_spec\">\n\t\t<div class=\"item_length\"><p class=\"cap\">● 毛长</p></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"item_spec\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"cap\">● 使用感</p>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_a02\"></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_b02\"></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_c02\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n  \n  \n<div class=\"item_wrap02 item_box_line clr\" id=\"brush03\">\n\t<p class=\"set_item_collection\"></p>\n  <p class=\"series_bodycopy\">选用松鼠毛中稀有度极高的加拿大松鼠毛。纤细精致的毛质亲肤舒适，同时兼具适度的挺度。较小的笔尖可表现细腻的层次变化。</p>\n  <div class=\"rgt pad_bottom15\"></div>\n  \n  <div class=\"clr wrap_spec\">\n\t\t<div class=\"item_length\"><p class=\"cap\">● 毛长</p></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"item_spec\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"cap\">● 使用感</p>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_a01\"></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_b02\"></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"spec_c02\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n  \n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"470\" height=\"265\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3NyR28jPCfA\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" class=\"item_line_collection mov_pad\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n  \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bt_sold\"><span><i class=\"fa fa-cart-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>已售罄</span></p>",
